<section class="product-section product-section--image-right" id="guarantee" aria-labelledby="s6-heading">
  <div class="product-section__inner">

    <div class="product-section__body">

      <div class="product-section__group">
        <p class="text-subtitle">Zero risk. Total peace.</p>
        <h2 class="h2" id="s6-heading">Give your cat their spot. Get your desk back.</h2>
        <p class="text-paragraph">
          Closeness without chaos. A happy cat one hand-reach away &mdash; and a keyboard that&rsquo;s finally yours.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="product-section__group">
        <div class="price-row">
          <span class="price-anchor">$150&ndash;$179</span>
          <span class="price-main">$79</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-small">Free shipping &middot; Ships in 1&ndash;2 days</p>
      </div>

      <div class="guarantee-strip">
        <span class="guarantee-strip__icon">&#x1F6E1;</span>
        <p class="guarantee-strip__text">
          <strong>30-day happy-cat guarantee.</strong> If your cat snubs it and you&rsquo;re not happy, we&rsquo;ll refund you in full &mdash; and you keep the bed. No questions, no hassle.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="product-section__cta">
        <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}products/deskpaws" class="btn btn--primary-fill btn--full">
          Claim My Cat&rsquo;s Spot &mdash; $79
        </a>
        <p class="trust-line">&#x1F512; Secure checkout &middot; Visa / Mastercard / PayPal</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="section-rule">

      <div class="product-section__group">
        <p class="text-subtitle">Have questions?</p>
        <h3 class="h3">We&rsquo;ve got answers.</h3>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-list" role="list">

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">Will my cat actually use it?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">Most cats claim it within the first 24 hours. Place it at desk height where they already like to sit, add a pinch of catnip, and let them investigate at their own pace. The deep bowl shape naturally appeals to cats that seek enclosed, nest-like spaces &mdash; that&rsquo;s most of them. And if yours is the exception, our 30-day guarantee means you&rsquo;re not out a penny.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">What desks does it fit?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">Works on solid wood, wooden panel, marble, and metal desks with a straight edge up to ~2 inches (5 cm) thick. Not ideal for thin glass or desks with unusual lips or curves. Not sure? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@deskpaws.com" style="color:var(--color-gold);">hello@deskpaws.com</a> and we&rsquo;ll tell you straight.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">Will it scratch or damage my desk?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">No. The G-clamp includes soft rubber padding on every contact point &mdash; top, bottom, and sides. No marks, no scratches, no damage to your surface finish. We&rsquo;ve tested it on wood, marble, and metal.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">Is it stable? My cat is a jumper.</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">The metal G-clamp locks tight &mdash; once you&rsquo;ve hand-tightened it, it doesn&rsquo;t move. The frame supports up to 50 lbs (more than any domestic cat), and the woven base distributes weight evenly. We&rsquo;ve had zero reports of wobble from an impact landing.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">How do I clean it?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">Remove the sherpa cushion cover, hand-wash with mild detergent in cold water, and air dry &mdash; don&rsquo;t put it in the dryer. The metal frame just needs a quick wipe down. Easy.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">How long does shipping take?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">We ship within 1&ndash;2 business days. Delivery to US addresses takes approximately 10 days. You&rsquo;ll receive a tracking number the moment it ships.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="product-section__gallery">
      <div class="product-section__slides" id="s6-slides">
        <div class="product-section__slide">
          {%- if section.settings.image_1 -%}
            {{ section.settings.image_1 | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.image_1.alt | default: 'DeskPaws product' }}
          {%- else -%}
            <img
              src="{{ 'product-topdown.png' | asset_url }}"
              alt="DeskPaws bed &mdash; top-down view showing nest shape"
              width="720"
              height="740"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
        <div class="product-section__slide">
          {%- if section.settings.image_2 -%}
            {{ section.settings.image_2 | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.image_2.alt | default: 'DeskPaws lifestyle' }}
          {%- else -%}
            <img
              src="{{ 'product-floating-2.png' | asset_url }}"
              alt="DeskPaws floating product view"
              width="720"
              height="740"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="product-section__controls" aria-label="Gallery navigation">
        <button class="btn-arrow btn-arrow--left" data-slides="s6-slides" data-dir="-1" aria-label="Previous image">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19.6293 4.46929C15.1122 2.22992 14.0195 0 14.0195 0V5.05512H0V6.94488H14.0098V12H14.0195C14.0195 12 15.1122 9.75118 19.6293 7.52126C21.0732 6.80315 22.5561 6.33071 24 6C22.5561 5.66929 21.0732 5.19685 19.6293 4.47874V4.46929Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button class="btn-arrow" data-slides="s6-slides" data-dir="1" aria-label="Next image">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19.6293 4.46929C15.1122 2.22992 14.0195 0 14.0195 0V5.05512H0V6.94488H14.0098V12H14.0195C14.0195 12 15.1122 9.75118 19.6293 7.52126C21.0732 6.80315 22.5561 6.33071 24 6C22.5561 5.66929 21.0732 5.19685 19.6293 4.47874V4.46929Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "6 — FAQ + Guarantee",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image_1",
      "label": "Gallery image 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image_2",
      "label": "Gallery image 2"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "FAQ + Guarantee"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
